# machine-ssh-hosts.md — private SSH inventory (DO NOT COMMIT)

Copy to **`machine-ssh-hosts.md`** (gitignored via `machine-*.md`) and fill in.

**Public policy:** [docs/ssh-hosts.md](docs/ssh-hosts.md)  
**Live config body:** Proton Pass **"SSH Host Config"** → `chezmoi apply` → `~/.ssh/config.local`

Do not put this filled file in any public repository.

